WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
Picture nine living religions,
from Hinduism to the Bahá'í Faith.

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.760
They sit in three groups.

3
00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.550
You study five of them, with
at least one from each group.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.680
Each religion meets the
same three questions.

5
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:15.200
What are humans like?

6
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.590
Where are we going?

7
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.260
How do we get there?

8
00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.070
How can you study a faith
that is not your own, fairly?

9
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.210
In this mission, you'll see how one set
of questions can compare very different

10
00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.390
religions without ranking them.

11
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:32.960
Then you'll weigh up whether those three
questions really fit every religion.

12
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:37.640
Your mission: find out how to study
a faith that is not your own, fairly.
